# Line ending policy for the repository.
#
# Text files are stored with LF in Git and checked out with LF on every
# platform, including Windows. This keeps the working tree consistent with the
# repository, and satisfies the linebreak-style rule in ESLint, which expects
# unix line endings.
#
# These settings take precedence over the local core.autocrlf configuration,
# so every collaborator gets the same result regardless of their Git setup.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must never be treated as text or have their bytes rewritten.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.zip   binary
